---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';

const title = 'Sewer Backup into Bathtub or Shower | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Water or sewage backing up into a bathtub or shower can point to a blocked main drain or sewer line. A-1 Drain Cleaning serves Mason City and North Iowa.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/services/sewer-backup-into-tub-shower/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container py-14 sm:py-18 lg:py-24">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-white">Services</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Sewer Backup into Bathtub or Shower</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">Mason City • North Iowa</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Sewer Backup into Bathtub or Shower</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">If water or sewage comes up through a bathtub or shower, the blockage may be farther down the drain system or in the main sewer line.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-start">
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">A common sewer-backup symptom</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Why is water coming up in the tub or shower?</h2>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
            <p>In a house without a basement, a bathtub or shower can be the first place a main sewer-line blockage becomes visible. Wastewater has to go somewhere when it cannot continue through the drain system, and a low fixture can become the overflow point.</p>
            <p>If the toilet, tub, and shower back up together, the restriction may be farther down a shared drain line instead of inside one fixture. The same thing can happen when the washing machine drains and water comes up through a tub or shower.</p>
            <p>Do not keep running water to test the system. Stop flushing toilets and avoid running the washing machine while wastewater is backing up. Keep people and pets away from sewage or contaminated water.</p>
            <p>A-1 Drain Cleaning looks at which fixtures are affected and how they respond when water is used. That helps identify whether the restriction is at a branch drain, the main drain, or the sewer line leaving the house.</p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Signs the blockage may be farther down the line</h2>
          <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">The shower backs up when the washing machine drains.</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water rises in the bathtub when a toilet is flushed.</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">The toilet, tub, and shower are affected together.</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Wastewater comes back through a low fixture even when that fixture is not being used.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <aside class="border border-slate-200 bg-[#1A1A68] p-7 text-white shadow-xl sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-300">Sewer backup</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black">Tell A-1 Drain Cleaning what the water is doing.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300">Tell us whether the tub, shower, toilet, sink, floor drain, or several fixtures are backing up together.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-6 block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-5 py-4 text-center font-black text-white">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
          <a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="mt-5 block font-black text-white underline underline-offset-4">Main drain cleaning →</a>
          <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="mt-3 block font-black text-white underline underline-offset-4">Sewer line cleaning →</a>
          <a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="mt-3 block font-black text-white underline underline-offset-4">Laundry drain problems →</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Related drain problems</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">The same blockage can show up in more than one fixture</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b]">Floor drain backups →</a>
          <a href="/services/washing-machine-basement-flooding/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b]">Washer and basement backups →</a>
          <a href="/services/toilet-clogs/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b]">Toilet clogs and backups →</a>
          <a href="/services/sewer-backup-emergency/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b]">Sewer backup emergency service →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
